## 🟦 **TypeScript Stack - Fordele og Ulemper**

### **Fordele for SagsHub:**
✅ **Unified Language:** Same syntax frontend og backend  
✅ **Type Safety:** End-to-end type safety  
✅ **Stakeholder Buy-in:** Mike kan forstå hele systemet  
✅ **Real-time:** WebSockets native i Node.js  
✅ **JSON Native:** Naturlig JSON håndtering  
✅ **NPM Ecosystem:** Massive pakke ecosystem  
✅ **Development Speed:** Hurtig iteration og debugging  

### **Ulemper:**
❌ **Less Mature:** Node.js/Express har mindre "batteries-included"  
❌ **Security:** Mere manual security implementation  
❌ **Performance Ceiling:** Python kan teoretisk set være hurtigere  

### **Konkret Eksempel:**
```typescript
// Express route - Mike kan læse og forstå dette
app.post('/api/cases', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {
  const newCase = await db.insert(cases).values({
    caseNumber: generateCaseNumber(),
    customerName: req.body.customerName,
    createdBy: req.session.userId
  }).returning();
  
  res.json(newCase);
});
```

