## 📊 **Performance Sammenligning**

### **Development Performance**
- **TypeScript:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (Hurtig iteration, hot reload)
- **Python:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐ (God, men langsom startup)

### **Runtime Performance**
- **Node.js:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐ (Excellent for I/O-heavy apps som SagsHub)
- **Python:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (Better for CPU-intensive tasks)

### **Memory Usage**
- **Node.js:** ⭐⭐⭐ (Higher base memory)
- **Python:** ⭐⭐⭐⭐ (More efficient memory usage)

**For SagsHub:** Case management er primært I/O-heavy (database queries, API calls), så Node.js performance profil passer perfekt.

